  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!24Fl!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb9a0c82-c8f0-410a-bdb7-7f18df30b321_3840x2160.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!24Fl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb9a0c82-c8f0-410a-bdb7-7f18df30b321_3840x2160.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A man opens his mail ballot. (Photo by <a href=\"https://www.gettyimages.com/search/2/image?artistexact=AJ_Watt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AJ_Watt</a>)</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Election Day is just over two weeks away, and voters across the country will have the chance to rewrite housing rules on minimum lot size, environmental review, and fees. Meanwhile, <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/us-30-year-mortgage-rate-hits-highest-nearly-three-years-2026-10-07/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">mortgage rates</a> are at their highest in nearly three years, deepening the housing and affordability crises nationwide.</p>\n<p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.slowboring.com/p/housing-is-on-the-ballot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
